# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Face data and trained models — NEVER commit these.
# They are biometric data belonging to real people, and they are regenerated
# locally by running the enrolment steps in the README.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The leading slash anchors these to the repository root. Without it, the
# pattern would also match docs/images/ and silently exclude the README artwork.
# 開頭的斜線把規則限制在倉庫根目錄；若沒有它，規則會連 docs/images/ 也一併
# 排除，令 README 的插圖無法上傳。
/Images/
/Images_processed/
/Images_backup*/
/Images_processed_backup*/
/model.yml
/labels.json

# The same data, in case somebody keeps it in a data/ sub-folder.
# 若有人把資料放在 data/ 子資料夾，同樣排除。
/data/Images/
/data/Images_processed/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The live database contains residents' names, room numbers and entry/exit
# history. Ship the schema (database_init.py) instead, not the data.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tooling / editors
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS noise
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Thonny
.thonny/

# Logs produced by the scheduled monthly reset
reset.log
*.log
